:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱我吧</span></p><p begin="00:17.431" end="00:18.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:17.431" end="00:17.773">KILL</span> <span begin="00:17.773" end="00:18.049">ME</span> <span begin="00:18.136" end="00:18.458">KILL</span> <span begin="00:18.458" end="00:18.920">ME</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">杀了我吧</span></p><p begin="00:21.267" end="00:23.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:21.267" end="00:22.426">愛憎愛憎</span><span begin="00:22.426" end="00:23.001">渦</span><span begin="00:23.001" end="00:23.315">巻い</span><span begin="00:23.315" end="00:23.818">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱恨交织 在心里翻腾</span></p><p begin="00:23.818" end="00:26.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:23.818" end="00:24.727">大東京</span><span begin="00:24.727" end="00:25.037">狂</span><span begin="00:25.037" end="00:25.354">騒</span><span begin="00:25.354" end="00:25.862">歌っ</span><span begin="00:25.862" end="00:26.265">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大东京的狂骚之歌</span></p><p begin="00:26.265" end="00:28.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:26.265" end="00:26.676">廻</span><span begin="00:26.676" end="00:26.940">れ</span><span begin="00:26.940" end="00:27.532">廻</span><span begin="00:27.532" end="00:27.816">れ</span><span begin="00:27.816" end="00:28.359">時代</span><span begin="00:28.359" end="00:28.616">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转吧转吧 沾裹着这时代</span></p><p begin="00:28.616" end="00:31.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:28.616" end="00:28.801">生</span><span begin="00:28.801" end="00:29.146">き</span><span begin="00:29.146" end="00:29.829">恥</span><span begin="00:29.829" end="00:29.951">に</span><span begin="00:29.951" end="00:30.058">ず</span><span begin="00:30.058" end="00:30.453">ぶ</span><span begin="00:30.453" end="00:30.665">濡</span><span begin="00:30.665" end="00:30.973">れ</span><span begin="00:30.973" end="00:31.371">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">活着的羞耻</span></p><p begin="00:31.371" end="00:33.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:31.371" end="00:32.635">愛憎愛憎</span><span begin="00:32.635" end="00:32.899">を</span><span begin="00:32.899" end="00:33.071">喰</span><span begin="00:33.071" end="00:33.375">らっ</span><span begin="00:33.375" end="00:33.849">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱恨交织 接受吧</span></p><p begin="00:33.949" end="00:36.274" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:33.949" end="00:34.551">参ろう</span><span begin="00:34.551" end="00:35.181">大層</span><span begin="00:35.181" end="00:35.430">な</span><span begin="00:35.430" end="00:35.915">様</span><span begin="00:35.915" end="00:36.274">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走吧 以堂堂正正的姿态</span></p><p begin="00:36.274" end="00:38.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:36.274" end="00:36.757">離</span><span begin="00:36.757" end="00:37.082">れ</span><span begin="00:37.082" end="00:37.657">離</span><span begin="00:37.657" end="00:38.035">れ</span><span begin="00:38.035" end="00:38.135">で</span><span begin="00:38.135" end="00:38.349">終い</span><span begin="00:38.349" end="00:38.799">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各分东西 就此结束</span></p><p begin="00:38.799" end="00:41.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:38.799" end="00:39.194">然ら</span><span begin="00:39.194" end="00:39.472">ば</span><span begin="00:39.472" end="00:40.076">又</span><span begin="00:40.076" end="00:40.240">逢</span><span begin="00:40.240" end="00:40.716">い</span><span begin="00:40.716" end="00:40.824">ま</span><span begin="00:40.824" end="00:41.053">しょ</span><span begin="00:41.053" end="00:41.624">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就这样 改天再见吧</span></p><p begin="00:43.871" end="00:46.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:43.871" end="00:44.079">ド</span><span begin="00:44.079" end="00:44.614">ラマ</span><span begin="00:44.614" end="00:45.235">チックに</span><span begin="00:45.235" end="00:45.682">溺れ</span><span begin="00:45.682" end="00:46.010">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">戏剧性地沉溺</span></p><p begin="00:46.010" end="00:48.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:46.010" end="00:46.453">未完</span><span begin="00:46.453" end="00:47.124">成な</span><span begin="00:47.124" end="00:47.760">私を</span><span begin="00:47.760" end="00:48.276">認め</span><span begin="00:48.276" end="00:48.557">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">承认那未完成体的我</span></p><p begin="00:48.657" end="00:50.756" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:48.657" end="00:48.890">気</span><span begin="00:48.890" end="00:49.319">休</span><span begin="00:49.319" end="00:49.694">め</span><span begin="00:49.694" end="00:49.961">の</span><span begin="00:49.961" end="00:50.298">フィク</span><span begin="00:50.298" end="00:50.756">ション</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">聊胜于无的虚构</span></p><p begin="00:50.756" end="00:53.477" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:50.756" end="00:51.232">嘘と</span><span begin="00:51.232" end="00:51.885">真</span><span begin="00:51.885" end="00:52.134">の</span><span begin="00:52.134" end="00:52.486">不協</span><span begin="00:52.486" end="00:52.863">和</span><span begin="00:52.863" end="00:53.477">音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谎言与真实的不协和音</span></p><p begin="00:53.477" end="00:56.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:53.477" end="00:53.810">出来</span><span begin="00:53.810" end="00:54.149">損</span><span begin="00:54.149" end="00:54.266">な</span><span begin="00:54.266" end="00:55.114">愛</span><span begin="00:55.114" end="00:55.415">でも</span><span begin="00:55.415" end="00:55.680">許</span><span begin="00:55.680" end="00:55.882">し</span><span begin="00:55.882" end="00:56.184">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请接受这份不完美的爱</span></p><p begin="00:56.184" end="00:58.646" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:56.184" end="00:56.914">構わない</span> <span begin="00:56.914" end="00:57.771">此の舞台</span><span begin="00:57.771" end="00:58.342">生き抜い</span><span begin="00:58.342" end="00:58.646">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没关系 只要能在这舞台上活下去</span></p><p begin="00:58.646" end="01:00.911" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:58.646" end="00:59.080">咬ませ</span><span begin="00:59.080" end="00:59.477">狗</span><span begin="00:59.477" end="00:59.739">の</span><span begin="00:59.739" end="01:00.342">武者</span><span begin="01:00.342" end="01:00.507">震</span><span begin="01:00.507" end="01:00.911">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">陪衬者的亢奋</span></p><p begin="01:00.911" end="01:02.512" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:00.911" end="01:01.128">ヤ</span><span begin="01:01.128" end="01:01.587">ラレっ</span><span begin="01:01.587" end="01:01.710">ぱ</span><span begin="01:01.710" end="01:02.009">な</span><span begin="01:02.009" end="01:02.162">し</span><span begin="01:02.162" end="01:02.512">じゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直被欺负下去</span></p><p begin="01:02.512" end="01:04.153" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:02.512" end="01:03.413">大人しくは</span><span begin="01:03.413" end="01:03.877">なれな</span><span begin="01:03.877" end="01:04.153">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可忍受不了</span></p><p begin="01:04.153" end="01:05.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:04.153" end="01:04.499">LUV</span> <span begin="01:04.499" end="01:04.839">ME</span> <span begin="01:04.890" end="01:05.142">LUV</span> <span begin="01:05.142" end="01:05.660">ME</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱我吧</span></p><p begin="01:05.414" end="01:06.771" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:05.414" end="01:05.753">正</span><span begin="01:05.753" end="01:05.920">しさ</